Rack::Attack safelisted once Labkit fully enforces
  # order defined
  when not every cohort both shadows and enforces (default state)
    is blocked - Rack::Attack independently sees its own over-limit counter
  when every cohort enforces but none shadow (misconfiguration)
    is still blocked - fully_enforced? requires shadow too, so Rack::Attack keeps throttling
  when every cohort both shadows and enforces
    is not blocked - Rack::Attack is safelisted and never consults its own (already over-limit) counter
    carries proactive RateLimit-* headers built from labkit counters

